      "searchCoverage": "Official Amazon S3 REST authentication (AWS Signature Version 4 Authorization header, x-amz-date, x-amz-content-sha256), ListBuckets, ListObjectsV2, HeadObject, virtual-hosted-style bucket endpoints, AWS US identity, and dated incident search for Amazon S3 security breach/incident reviewed on 2026-09-13. Pinned OpenConnector signs every request with signAwsSigV4Request and builds hosts as s3.{region}.amazonaws.com or {bucket}.s3.{region}.amazonaws.com. Native templates cannot express HMAC signing or those computed hosts. No current unresolved S3 control-plane customer-account compromise is asserted. This is not a breach-free claim.",
